{
    "title": "Weather Forecast & Live Radar",
    "description": "We have weather forecast & channels with accurate weather and air quality information, also with smart AI Life Planner and powerful live radar capabilities, a completely free weather app.\r\n\r\nNo matter where you are, this Weather app provides you with accurate and detailed weather forecast information, including hourly, daily, and 15-day forecasts.\r\n\r\nOur AI Life Planner also provides you with accurate and smart weather recommendations. Just ask a question with one click, and you can get a quick answer to get better help for your trip and avoid unexpected weather.\r\n\r\nThe weather app automatically detects the weather forecast for your current location. You can also view detailed local and global weather reports in the app. You can go to other pages for location management to manage the weather in multiple global locations easily.\r\n\r\nApart from daily forecast, more detailed weather information is available in the weather forecast, including atmospheric pressure, extreme weather conditions, visibility distance, perceived temperature forecast, relative humidity, wind speed and direction.\r\n\r\nThe main function:\r\n- Free accurate live weather forecast\r\nUpdate weather conditions in real time and check the latest and most accurate weather forecast anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\n- 24 hours, today, tomorrow, and next 15 days' weather forecast\r\nDetailed 24-hour weather forecast, view hourly weather forecast and track the forecast for the next 15 days, know the weather in advance, and prepare your plans carefully.\r\n\r\n-Accurate radar functionality\r\nWith our storm radar capabilities, you can track storms, monitor rain patterns, and receive local severe weather alerts, allowing you to plan your event scientifically and put safety first.\r\n\r\n- Complete weather information\r\nDisplay all weather information: atmospheric pressure, weather conditions, visibility distance, perceived temperature, relative humidity, wind speed and direction.\r\n\r\n- Weather disaster alerts\r\nPredict severe and extreme weather like hurricane, get weather alerts and take early precautions.\r\n\r\n- Weather notification bar\r\nWith real-time updates, you don't need to open the Weather app or go back to your desktop to check the weather.\r\n\r\n- Manage weather reports for multiple cities\r\nThis weather forecast app can detect your location and display local weather conditions via the web or GPS. You need to apply for location permission to provide you with the above features so that we can provide you with better services.\r\nYou can choose other cities in the world that you like and keep track of the local weather.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us.\r\nE-mail: ContactCenter@weather365d.com\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://weather365d.com/weatherforecast/privacy-policy/\r\nUser Agreement: https://weather365d.com/weatherforecast/terms-of-service/",
    "descriptionHTML": "We have weather forecast &amp; channels with accurate weather and air quality information, also with smart AI Life Planner and powerful live radar capabilities, a completely free weather app.<br><br>No matter where you are, this Weather app provides you with accurate and detailed weather forecast information, including hourly, daily, and 15-day forecasts.<br><br>Our AI Life Planner also provides you with accurate and smart weather recommendations. Just ask a question with one click, and you can get a quick answer to get better help for your trip and avoid unexpected weather.<br><br>The weather app automatically detects the weather forecast for your current location. You can also view detailed local and global weather reports in the app. You can go to other pages for location management to manage the weather in multiple global locations easily.<br><br>Apart from daily forecast, more detailed weather information is available in the weather forecast, including atmospheric pressure, extreme weather conditions, visibility distance, perceived temperature forecast, relative humidity, wind speed and direction.<br><br>The main function:<br>- Free accurate live weather forecast<br>Update weather conditions in real time and check the latest and most accurate weather forecast anytime, anywhere.<br><br>- 24 hours, today, tomorrow, and next 15 days&#39; weather forecast<br>Detailed 24-hour weather forecast, view hourly weather forecast and track the forecast for the next 15 days, know the weather in advance, and prepare your plans carefully.<br><br>-Accurate radar functionality<br>With our storm radar capabilities, you can track storms, monitor rain patterns, and receive local severe weather alerts, allowing you to plan your event scientifically and put safety first.<br><br>- Complete weather information<br>Display all weather information: atmospheric pressure, weather conditions, visibility distance, perceived temperature, relative humidity, wind speed and direction.<br><br>- Weather disaster alerts<br>Predict severe and extreme weather like hurricane, get weather alerts and take early precautions.<br><br>- Weather notification bar<br>With real-time updates, you don&#39;t need to open the Weather app or go back to your desktop to check the weather.<br><br>- Manage weather reports for multiple cities<br>This weather forecast app can detect your location and display local weather conditions via the web or GPS. You need to apply for location permission to provide you with the above features so that we can provide you with better services.<br>You can choose other cities in the world that you like and keep track of the local weather.<br><br>If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us.<br>E-mail: ContactCenter@weather365d.com<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://weather365d.com/weatherforecast/privacy-policy/<br>User Agreement: https://weather365d.com/weatherforecast/terms-of-service/",
